{"title":"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The integers greater than one are arranged in five columns as follows:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/b/afbd2edf35ad29f633ac5cf8348f5cbe773fdc17.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{tabular}{c c c c c}\\ &amp; 2 &amp; 3 &amp; 4 &amp; 5\\\\ 9 &amp; 8 &amp; 7 &amp; 6 &amp;\\ \\\\ \\ &amp; 10 &amp; 11 &amp; 12 &amp; 13\\\\ 17 &amp; 16 &amp; 15 &amp; 14 &amp;\\ \\\\ \\ &amp; . &amp; . &amp; . &amp; .\\\\ \\end{tabular}\\]\" width=\"161\" height=\"91\" />\n</p><p>(Four consecutive integers appear in each row; in the first, third and other odd numbered rows, the integers appear in the last four columns and increase from left to right; in the second, fourth and other even numbered rows, the integers appear in the first four columns and increase from right to left.)\n</p><p>In which column will the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a7211efdf41d2bc909e3d0549b2ab5cba0356ca5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"17\" /> fall?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/4/1f41182bb442d5cac1e8960be838496cce1ef5e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } \\text{first} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }\\text{second} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } \\text{third} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } \\text{fourth} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }\\text{fifth}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"484\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We try pairing numbers with the column number they're in.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/c/27c34e3fa32ba5b614d7dbc4bbeae41344bcac31.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{tabular}{c c}\\ \\text{Number} &amp; \\text{Column Number} \\\\ 2 &amp; 2\\\\ 3 &amp; 3\\\\ 4 &amp; 4\\\\ 5 &amp; 5\\\\ 6 &amp; 4\\\\ 7 &amp; 3\\\\ 8 &amp; 2\\\\ 9 &amp; 1\\\\ 10 &amp; 2\\\\ 11 &amp; 3\\\\ 12 &amp; 4\\\\ \\end{tabular}\\]\" width=\"199\" height=\"232\" />\n</p><p>Now we can see a pattern. The column number starts at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, goes up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, then goes back down to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and repeats. Each of these blocks has a length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so the column number has a period of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/c/bbc1335617d809b0de446bca360aa0859e59a647.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000\\equiv8(\\bmod\\,8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is in the same column as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which is the second column. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/d/f0d5b8fdfd2bd98c8be0bad569663660c33f3438.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{B}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME\" title=\"1974 AHSME\">1974 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1974 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1974\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Prob